From 4bea1f9402568434bbb95421d9da7cfe8fb23839 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tao Yang <Tao.Yang1@nxp.com>
Date: Tue, 26 May 2026 19:43:26 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] rteval: Tailored for NXP boards and Yocto rootfs

- Remove DMI info collection (not available on ARM boards)
- Remove sysreport/sosreport (not available in Yocto)
- Remove NetworkInfo from report (reduces dependencies)
- Change kcompile from allmodconfig to defconfig (ARM boards
  have limited memory)
- Use /etc/os-release for OS detection instead of redhat/fedora-release
- Remove LANG env variable from service status check (not set in Yocto)
- Remove -tt flag from shebang (deprecated in Python 3)

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [embedded platform specific]
---
 rteval-cmd                       |  7 +------
 rteval/__init__.py               |  3 ---
 rteval/modules/loads/kcompile.py |  2 +-
 rteval/rteval_text.xsl           | 16 ----------------
 rteval/sysinfo/__init__.py       | 13 ++-----------
 rteval/sysinfo/osinfo.py         | 14 +++++++-------
 rteval/sysinfo/services.py       |  2 +-
 7 files changed, 12 insertions(+), 45 deletions(-)

diff --git a/rteval-cmd b/rteval-cmd
index 45d9f3a..73e5669 100755
--- a/rteval-cmd
+++ b/rteval-cmd
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-#!/usr/bin/python3 -tt
+#!/usr/bin/python3
